Structured data found: {{ $json.schemaTypes }}
Question-phrased headings: {{ $json.questionHeadings }}
Visible words: {{ $json.wordCount }}

FAILED CHECKS (the only problems you may write about)
{{ $json.issueList || 'none reported' }}

